      "version": "1.1.0",
      "description": "<h1>Changelog</h1>\n<h2>1.1.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete rewrite of the per-raid hook. Previously used <code>IOnBeforeEventRequestData</code>, which is dead code in SPT and never fires. Mod was silently applying the same time every raid until server restart.</li>\n<li>Now hooks <code>MatchController.ConfigureOfflineRaid</code> via Harmony postfix, which fires correctly on every raid start.</li>\n<li>Replaced <code>Console.WriteLine</code> with <code>ISptLogger</code> (injected).</li>\n<li>Replaced <code>ServiceLocator</code> with proper DI injection throughout.</li>\n<li>Config reworked: dropped <code>AllowIncrease</code> and <code>AllowDecrease</code> in favor of a single <code>Bias</code> float using an odds-ratio model.</li>\n<li>Config file is now resolved relative to the DLL, folder can be renamed freely.</li>\n<li>Server console now logs map name, delta, and final raid time on each raid start.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>1.0.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n",
